  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can shove your opponents around the battlefield to gain a tactical advantage.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> After making a successful melee attack against an opponent up to one size category larger than you, you can choose to move that opponent 1 square in any direction as a Free Action. You can't Bantha Rush an opponent that's being <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grabbed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grabbed\">Grabbed</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a>, and you can't Bantha Rush your opponent into a solid object or another creature's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fighting_Space\" title=\"Fighting Space\">Fighting Space</a>.</p>",
